    <bpmn:process id="W_W4329" name="W4329. Dormitory Preventive &amp; Reactive Maintenance Operations" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: PM cycle; resident maintenance request; breakdown
Frequency: PM scheduled + reactive per request
Volume: Per-site maintenance across housed units/systems
Owner: Facilities/Housing Ops (VS-138/VS-20.3)
Participants: Facilities (VS-138), Maintenance Vendor/Technician, Housing Ops, HSE (VS-24), Asset (VS-35)
Source: workflow W4329 — Dormitory Preventive &amp; Reactive Maintenance Operations</bpmn:documentation>
