      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4329_Task5" name="Facilities/Housing Ops set the dormitory PM schedule (HVAC, plumbing…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Facilities/Housing Ops set the dormitory PM schedule (HVAC, plumbing, electrical, fixtures, appliances, structure) and the reactive work-order process
Responsible (R): Facilities / Housing Ops
Accountable (A): Housing Ops Lead
Duration: Standard</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4329_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4329_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4329_Task6" name="Residents/staff log maintenance requests; Facilities/vendor execute PM &amp;…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Residents/staff log maintenance requests; Facilities/vendor execute PM &amp; reactive repair, and verify completion with the resident
Responsible (R): Facilities / Vendor / Resident
Accountable (A): Housing Ops Lead
Duration: Per request</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4329_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4329_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4329_Task7" name="Housing Ops/HSE track resolution SLA, recurring failures, and safety-critical…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Housing Ops/HSE track resolution SLA, recurring failures, and safety-critical (electrical/gas/fire-system) priority, and feed asset lifecycle (W4332)
Responsible (R): Housing Ops / HSE
Accountable (A): Housing Ops Lead / HSE Mgr
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4329_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4329_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4329_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
