        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-664 (ensure controlled execution — Housing Facility Maintenance, Vendor, Cost &amp; Housing Analytics (PA-144.3).) | - CTL-664: PM current; reactive within SLA; safety-critical prioritized; habitability maintained
Owner: Facilities/Housing Ops (VS-138/VS-20.3)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
