    <bpmn:process id="W_W4330" name="W4330. Housing Vendor/Property-Manager Sourcing, Contract &amp; SLA" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Vendor contracting; SLA review; underperformance
Frequency: Per contract + ongoing governance
Volume: Housing vendors (property-manager, housekeeping, security, maintenance) per site
Owner: Procurement (VS-34) / Housing Ops / Contingent (VS-98)
Participants: Procurement (VS-34), Legal (VS-100.3), Housing Ops, Facilities (VS-138), Finance (VS-17.4), HSE (VS-24)
Source: workflow W4330 — Housing Vendor/Property-Manager Sourcing, Contract &amp; SLA</bpmn:documentation>
