        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Procurement/Legal source &amp; contract housing vendors (property-manager, housekeeping, security, maintenance) with SLA, safety/welfare terms, insurance, and audit rights per VS-34/VS-98
Responsible (R): Procurement / Legal / Housing Ops
Accountable (A): CFO / VP Legal
Duration: Per contract</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4330_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4330_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4330_Task7" name="Housing Ops govern day-to-day vendor performance vs SLA (cleanliness, security…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Housing Ops govern day-to-day vendor performance vs SLA (cleanliness, security, maintenance resolution, welfare), and conduct joint reviews
Responsible (R): Housing Ops / Facilities
Accountable (A): Housing Ops Lead
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4330_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4330_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4330_Task8" name="Finance/HSE audit vendor cost, insurance/compliance, HSE, and enforce…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Finance/HSE audit vendor cost, insurance/compliance, HSE, and enforce consequence/breach per contract
Responsible (R): Finance / HSE / Procurement
Accountable (A): CFO / HSE Mgr
Duration: Periodic</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4330_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4330_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4330_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
