        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-128 (ensure dormitory safety &amp; welfare compliance.) | - CTL-664: recovery reconciled to cost; deductions accurate (HRIS-linked); leakage RA-monitored (VS-118)
Owner: Finance (VS-17.4) / Shared Services (VS-72) / Housing Ops</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
