    <bpmn:process id="W_W4336" name="W4336. Housing Portfolio Performance, Cost &amp; Welfare Analytics" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Quarterly/annual review; sustainability/welfare report
Frequency: Quarterly + annual
Volume: Enterprise housing portfolio performance
Owner: Housing Ops / People Analytics (VS-103.3) / Finance (VS-17.4)
Participants: HR/EX (VS-103), People Analytics (VS-103.3), Finance (VS-17.4), Strategy (VS-33), HSE (VS-24), Sustainability (VS-25)
Source: workflow W4336 — Housing Portfolio Performance, Cost &amp; Welfare Analytics</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4336_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4336_Lane1" name="Housing Ops">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4336_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4336_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4336_Lane2" name="Strategy">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4336_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4336_Lane3" name="HR">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4336_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4336_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4336_Start5" name="Quarterly/annual review; sustainability/welfare report">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4336_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4336_Task6" name="Housing Ops/Analytics consolidate portfolio KPIs — occupancy/utilization, net…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Housing Ops/Analytics consolidate portfolio KPIs — occupancy/utilization, net cost/employee, retention-ROI (W4328), safety/compliance status, welfare/satisfaction, vendor SLA
Responsible (R): Housing Ops / People Analytics / Finance
Accountable (A): Head of People Services / CFO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4336_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4336_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4336_Task7" name="Strategy/Finance benchmark vs allowance-alternative &amp; market, identify…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Strategy/Finance benchmark vs allowance-alternative &amp; market, identify improvement (coverage, cost, vendor), and prioritize actions
Responsible (R): Strategy / Finance / Housing Ops
Accountable (A): CHRO / COO / CFO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4336_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4336_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4336_Task8" name="HR/Sustainability report the housing-welfare outcome (retention, welfare…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: HR/Sustainability report the housing-welfare outcome (retention, welfare, safety) into the people/sustainability narrative (VS-25/VS-103) and board assurance (VS-36/VS-21)
Responsible (R): HR / Sustainability / Leadership
Accountable (A): CHRO / Sustainability Lead
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4336_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4336_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4336_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4336_Annotation10">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-664 (ensure controlled execution — Housing Facility Maintenance, Vendor, Cost &amp; Housing Analytics (PA-144.3).) | - CTL-664: portfolio KPIs reviewed quarterly; improvement prioritized; welfare outcome reported (VS-25/VS-103)
Owner: Housing Ops / People Analytics (VS-103.3) / Finance (VS-17.4)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
